 "title": "LLaDA-Image release: open diffusion model for generation and editing",
 "summary": "inclusionAI released LLaDA-Image, a 6B Diffusion Transformer with a unified checkpoint for generation and editing. Two versions are offered: LLaDA-Image (50 steps for max quality) and LLaDA-Image-Turbo (distilled, 2-4 steps). The model supports text-to-image and native image editing via a new ComfyUI integration by RealRebelAI.",
